<title>UK: WH Smith Retail names Hodson as MD.</title>
<headline>WH Smith Retail names Hodson as MD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer WH Smith Group Plc said on Thursday that it has appointed Beverley Hodson as managing director of WH Smith Retail and will join the board.</p>
<p>Hodson, who was previously managing director of Dolcis and Cable and Co, replaces Peter Bamford who resigned from the company in April.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
